WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:14,620
can I be using a different computer on the internet while using the rife that kind of

00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,820
goes to that other question as well.

00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:26,460
So can I be sitting in my bed, running the rife and then open up my iPad or my laptop and

00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,740
be on the internet while using the rife?

00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:31,020
Yes, you can.

00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:38,380
So the only caveat to that would be it, you know, it could interfere with your computer function

00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:43,860
if the bulb was sitting right next to the computer or the iPad, that's just a possibility.

00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:47,820
Is the iPad or the computer, the laptop that I'm using, you get to interfere with my

00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:48,820
treatment?

00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:49,820
That's my big question.

00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,620
I don't want it to interfere with my treatment.

00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,780
I'll stay off of it if it's not going to hurt my treatment.

00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:56,820
It's not going to hurt your treatment.

00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:01,420
So no, you could, you're fine to do that.

00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:05,260
It will not affect the frequencies coming out of the bulb.

00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:08,220
It won't affect your treatment negatively in any way.

